  "navigation": {
    "_note": "导航结构 —— 两端的导航从这一份生成，不再各自硬编码一份页面清单。\n\n对话为主的三条落法：\n  1. 对话是唯一主干，也是两端的默认落地页；\n  2. 能力（模型/提供商/MCP/技能/记忆/流程/提示词/编排）收成一块，不各占一行；\n  3. 表达形态（语音/直播/客服）是**对话的形态**，由对话页的形态切换器进入，不是并列 tab。\n\nsection.items 里放的是 capability id；生成器按各端的 route/labelKey/icon 解析，\n某一端没有路由就跳过（端侧专属是允许的）。",
    "desktop": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "id": "converse",
          "labelKey": "nav.section.converse",
          "items": ["chat"]
        },
        {
          "id": "work",
          "labelKey": "nav.section.work",
          "items": ["tasks", "group"]
        },
        {
          "id": "capability",
          "labelKey": "nav.section.capability",
          "collapsible": true,
          "items": [
            "models",
            "providers",
            "mcp",
            "skills",
            "memory",
            "flows",
            "prompt-settings",
            "workflow-studio"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "more",
          "labelKey": "nav.section.more",
          "collapsible": true,
          "items": [
            "computer-use",
            "jdm-editor",
            "previews",
            "trace",
            "logs",
            "discovery",
            "resonance",
            "telencephalon"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "footer": ["settings"],
      "conversationModes": ["chat", "voice"]
    },
    "mobile": {
      "tabs": [
        {
          "id": "chat",
          "labelKey": "nav.tab.chat",
          "capability": "chat",
          "alsoRoutes": ["/conversations"]
        },
        {
          "id": "tasks",
          "labelKey": "nav.tab.tasks",
          "capability": "tasks"
        },
        {
          "id": "capability",
          "labelKey": "nav.tab.capability",
          "container": "/manage",
          "alsoRoutes": ["/flows"]
        },
        {
          "id": "me",
          "labelKey": "nav.tab.me",
          "capability": "settings"
        }
      ],
      "conversationModes": ["chat", "voice", "livestream", "customer-service"]
    }
  },

  "_containers": {
